        "description": " No need to click or press any buttons.\n\nAfter installing the app, connect the Headset to the computer, go to the root directory and create a \"vrvision\" folder. When creating this folder, just add the 360 video in .MP4 format and that's it.\n\nWhen starting the app the Player will start automatically\n\n*** We are currently only supporting 360 videos, not Side by side.\n\nTo insert a video\n\n1. Connect the headset to the computer\n2. create a folder in Root called \"vrvision\"\n3. Put only 1 file in .mp4 360 mono format\n\nReady, when opening the software it will automatically pull the video and start the automatic play",
